nt from all flanks, maximizes mobility, and prepares to shadow or oppose the white king. This is standard endgame theory: centralize your king when possible. While no checkmate can occur here, playing precisely maintains theoretical correctness and would matter if more pieces were present.\n\nAnswer: K: f5-e5"}
